    "description": {
      "content": "sandbox-svc — the favorite-items feature (FEAT-001).\n\nThree routes: favorite an item, list your favorites, un-favorite one. Every\nroute acts on the calling user's own rows only; the user is taken from the\naccess token, never from the request, so no route accepts a user id.\n\nPaths, methods and tags are emitted by nexcommon's own generator\n(`GenerateSwaggerDocs`, served at `/swagger/swagger.yaml`), so they cannot\ndrift from the routes the service registers. What is authored on top of it\nhere is the response side: the `{success, header, payload}` envelope, the\nper-status coverage, the business error codes, and examples taken from the\nreal DTOs — none of which the generator can see.\n",
